## 1. Admin 

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2 Signup / Register 
POST http://localhost:9091/api/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "firstname": "",
  "lastname": ""
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resetPasswordToken": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 1.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9091/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

## 2. User 

### 2.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 2.2 Signup / Register
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

### 2.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "",
  "password": "",
  "passwordConfirmation": ""
}

### 2.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9091/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

## 3. Content
### 3.1 Student
### 3.1.1 Create Student
POST http://localhost:9091/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

{
  "data": {
    "name": "",
    "mobile": "",
    "cardId": ""
  }
}

### 3.1.2 Get Student
GET http://localhost:9091/api/students
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

### 3.1.3 Update Student
PUT http://localhost:9091/api/students/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

{
  "data": {
    "name": "",
    "mobile": "",
    "cardId": ""
  }
}

### 3.1.4 Delete Student
DELETE http://localhost:9091/api/students/3
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

### 3.1.5 Get Student by id
GET http://localhost:9091/api/students/3
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

